  "description": {
    "raw": "By magically altering the way your vocal cords create sounds,\nyou can emulate the vocal inflections of dragons. This grants\na +6 circumstance bonus on Charisma checks and Charismarelated\nskill checks when dealing with dragons.\n\nIn addition, your voice is much louder than normal, halving\nthe penalties to others’ Perception checks to hear you due to\ndistance, intervening doors, and so on.",
    "search_text": "\"by magically altering the way your vocal cords create sounds,\\nyou can emulate the vocal inflections of dragons. this grants\\na +6 circumstance bonus on charisma checks and charismarelated\\nskill checks when dealing with dragons.\\n\\nin addition, your voice is much louder than normal, halving\\nthe penalties to others’ perception checks to hear you due to\\ndistance, intervening doors, and so on.\"",
